  "fullContentHtml": "\n<h1 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-e52a0102 gb-headline-text\">MPESB Group 5 Paramedical Result 2026</h1>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-659bd175\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-a344b6f7\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-31d42cf5\">\n\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c57ae0af gb-headline-text\">Post Date: <time class=\"entry-date published\" datetime=\"2026-06-10T11:07:21+05:30\">June 10, 2026</time></p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<span class=\"custom-post-time\">11:07 am</span>\n\n</div>\n\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-550ae316 short_Details gb-headline-text\"></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><a href=\"https://esb.mp.gov.in/e_default.html\">Madhya Pradesh Employees Selection Board MPESB</a>,</strong> <span style=\"color: #000000;\">has released&nbsp;the<strong> Result</strong> On the <strong>official website</strong> for the recruitment of <strong>Group-5 Staff Nurse , Paramedical and Other Posts. </strong></span><span style=\"color: #000000;\">The exam was conducted on <strong data-start=\"371\" data-end=\"412\">17-23 April 2026</strong>. The <strong>MPESB Group 5 Paramedical application process</strong>&nbsp;started on&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"458\" data-end=\"478\">16 March 2026</strong>, and candidates were able to submit their applications until&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"540\" data-end=\"560\">30 March 2026</strong>. Candidates can check their <strong data-start=\"589\" data-end=\"620\">Result</strong>&nbsp;using their&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"633\" data-end=\"693\">Enrollment Number, Registration Number, or Date of Birth</strong>&nbsp;by logging into the portal. The direct link is provided below.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n<p></p>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-9849916c\">\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p></p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vinod.sarkarinaukri&amp;hl=en_IN\" class=\"apply-button\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n        Download SarkariResult App Now\n    </a>\n    </div>\n    \n<div class=\"social-buttons\"><!-- WhatsApp Button --> <a class=\"social-button whatsapp\" href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaAbQf01NCrYADMLt00L\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> WhatsApp </a> <!-- Telegram Button --> <a class=\"social-button telegram\" href=\"https://t.me/SarkariExam_info\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> Telegram </a></div>\n\n\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-f58e6ca1\">\n\n<h2 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-2ca5a791 gb-headline-text\">MPESB Group 5 Paramedical Result 2026</h2>\n\n\n<h3 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-7d5f86e8 gb-headline-text\">MPESB Group 5 Post Examination 2026 : Short Details</h3>\n\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-79adf169 gb-headline-text\"><a href=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/mpesb-group-5-paramedical-2026/\">SarkariResult.com.cm</a></p>\n\n<div class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-303102a8\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-d96c68be\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-d96c68be\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-16a90584\">\n\n<h4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-22b2e02b gb-headline-text\"><strong>Important Dates</strong></h4>\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-3b2f0e17 gb-headline-text\"><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Apply Online Start Date : <strong>16 March 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Apply Online Last Date : <strong>30 March 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Last Date For Fee Payment : <strong>30 March 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Correction Last Date :<strong> 04 April 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Exam Date :<strong> 17-23 April 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Admit Card :&nbsp;<strong>10 April 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Answer Key : <strong>24 April 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Result Date : <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>09 June 2026 Available Now</strong></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Candidates are advised to confirm from the <strong>MPESB </strong>official website.&nbsp;</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-fcbb81ff\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-fcbb81ff\">\n\n<h4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4ddaf9ee gb-headline-text\"><strong>Application Fee</strong></h4>\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-989f3ffd gb-headline-text\"><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">For <strong>General &amp; Other States </strong>:&nbsp;<strong>₹ 560/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">For <strong>OBC,</strong> <strong>SC, ST, Candidates</strong>&nbsp;:&nbsp;<strong>₹&nbsp;</strong><strong><span class=\"blue bold\">310/-</span></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">For <strong>Portal Charge</strong> : <strong>Included</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Payment Mode (Online):</strong>&nbsp;You can make the payment using the following methods:</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Debit Card</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Credit Card</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Internet Banking</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">IMPS</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Cash Card / Mobile Wallet</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-6b6fbcac\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-8aa46b64\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-0f18d865\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-0f18d865\">\n<h5 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-0b3ada47 gb-headline-text\">MPESB Group 5 Post Notification 2026 : Age Limit As On 01 January 2026</h5>\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-28dede61 gb-headline-text\"><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Minimum Age :<strong> 18 Years.</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Maximum Age :&nbsp;<strong>40 Years (UR/ EWS)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Maximum Age :&nbsp;<strong>45 Years (OBC/ SC/ ST/ PH/ Female)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>MPESB</strong> provides age relaxation for the <strong>Group-5 </strong>position as per their regulations.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-860b2712\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-860b2712\">\n\n<h5 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-f2184b83 gb-headline-text\"><strong>Total Post</strong></h5>\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4259c0c2 gb-headline-text\">373 Posts</div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<!-- SarkariResult -->\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vinod.sarkarinaukri&amp;hl=en_IN\" class=\"apply-button\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n        Download SarkariResult App Now\n    </a>\n    </div>\n    \n\n</div>\n\n\n\n<!-- SarkariResult -->\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-ec1f6e4c\">\n<h6 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c7683bda gb-headline-text\">MPESB Group 5 Paramedical Recruitment 2026 : Vacancy Details </h6>\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-60ccea19 gb-headline-text\"><table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; height: 125px;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 50%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Category Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>No. Of Post</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 50%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">General</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">139</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 50%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">EWS</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">34</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">OBC</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">92</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">SC</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">39</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">ST</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">69</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 26.6175%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 73.3825%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Eligibility Criteria</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 26.6175%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Physiotherapist</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 73.3825%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Bachelor’s degree in Physical Therapy (BPT) with registration under the MP Paramedical Council is required. Pay Scale: ₹36,200 – ₹1,14,800 (Level-9). For full details, refer to the official notification.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 26.6175%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Counselor</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 73.3825%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Master’s degree in Social Work (MSW) with a Post Graduate Diploma in Counseling and Family Therapy (PGDCFT) is required. Pay Scale: ₹25,300 – ₹80,500 (Level-6).</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 26.6175%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Pharmacist Grade II</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 73.3825%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">10+2 (Intermediate) with PCB subjects, along with a Degree or Diploma in Pharmacy and registration with the MP Pharmacy Council is required. Pay Scale: ₹25,300 – ₹80,500 (Level-6).<br>\n</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 26.6175%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Ophthalmic Assistant</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 73.3825%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">10+2 (Intermediate) with PCB subjects and a Diploma in Ophthalmic Assistant is required, along with registration under the MP Paramedical Council. Pay Scale: ₹28,700 – ₹91,300 (Level-7).<br>\n</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 26.6175%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">O.T. Technician</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 73.3825%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">10+2 (Intermediate) with PCB subjects and a 1-year course in Operation Theatre Technician is required, along with registration under the MP Paramedical Council. Pay Scale: ₹25,300 – ₹80,500 (Level-6).<br>\n</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #800000;\">You May Also Check : </span></strong><strong><a href=\"http://sarkariresult.com.cm/rsmssb-surveyor-and-mines-supervisor-online-form-2024/\">RSMSSB Surveyor and Mines Supervisor Recruitment 2025</a></strong></span>\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-659bd175\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-a344b6f7\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-31d42cf5\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"background-color: #000080; color: #ffffff; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>&nbsp;How To Download MPESB Group 5 Paramedical Result 2026&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li data-section-id=\"1w21z4y\" data-start=\"167\" data-end=\"247\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Visit the official website of</span><br data-start=\"199\" data-end=\"202\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\"><span class=\"whitespace-normal\">Madhya Pradesh Employees Selection Board</span></span></span></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"13ubz82\" data-start=\"249\" data-end=\"322\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">On the homepage, click on</span><br data-start=\"277\" data-end=\"280\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong data-start=\"283\" data-end=\"322\">“Model Answer Key / Response Sheet”</strong></span></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"15evnto\" data-start=\"324\" data-end=\"391\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Find and click on</span><br data-start=\"344\" data-end=\"347\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong data-start=\"350\" data-end=\"391\">“Group 5 Paramedical Result 2026”</strong></span></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"bp6b5o\" data-start=\"393\" data-end=\"468\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Enter your login details:</span>\n<ul data-start=\"425\" data-end=\"468\">\n<li data-section-id=\"1catb75\" data-start=\"425\" data-end=\"447\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Application Number</span></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1pshzv4\" data-start=\"451\" data-end=\"468\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Date of Birth</span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"pxpyh\" data-start=\"470\" data-end=\"500\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Click on <strong data-start=\"482\" data-end=\"500\">Submit / Login</strong></span></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"13hgzm8\" data-start=\"502\" data-end=\"569\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Your <strong data-start=\"510\" data-end=\"541\">result</strong> will appear on the screen</span></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"rccobr\" data-start=\"571\" data-end=\"625\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Download and <strong data-start=\"587\" data-end=\"609\">save/print the PDF</strong> for reference</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"background-color: #000080; color: #ffffff; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>&nbsp;MPESB Group 5 Post Recruitment 2026 : Mode Of Selection&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Screening Test</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Subject Knowledge Test</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Interview (Viva-Voce)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Document Verification</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Medical Examination</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052; font-size: 14pt;\"><b>Join Our WhatsApp Channel</b></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><a href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaAbQf01NCrYADMLt00L\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Follow Now</a></strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center